        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, tram
For the disposal of steel, aluminium  and cooper a cut off allocation is applied. ;
UUID: 362343f1-e0dd-4c36-8821-f7805163315e
The inventory includes disposal processes for non-metal bulk materials. For the disposal standard transport distances are employed.
Location: Data represent Swiss conditions
Technology: no technologies are specified
Time period: Data represents conditions of the 1990ties
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data is based on the material consumption of vehicles.  
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_362343f1-e0dd-4c36-8821-f7805163315e.xml</text>
